        className: "language-text",
        children: "Parser\n[ ] malformed JSON → 400 INVALID_JSON\n[ ] invalid enum → 400 INVALID_PAYLOAD / INVALID_JSON\n[ ] malformed XML → 400 INVALID_XML\n\nValidation\n[ ] missing required field → 400 VALIDATION_FAILED\n[ ] nested item invalid → field path benar\n[ ] custom constraint invalid → custom error code benar\n\nDomain\n[ ] not found → 404 RESOURCE_NOT_FOUND / domain-specific code\n[ ] duplicate → 409 DUPLICATE_RESOURCE\n[ ] invalid state transition → 409 INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION\n[ ] business semantic error → 422 BUSINESS_RULE_VIOLATION\n\nSecurity\n[ ] missing token → 401\n[ ] insufficient permission → 403\n[ ] hidden resource policy → 404 jika dipilih\n\nInfrastructure\n[ ] upstream timeout → 504\n[ ] DB unavailable → 503\n[ ] unexpected exception → 500 INTERNAL_ERROR\n\nContract\n[ ] all error responses contain code/message/correlationId/errors\n[ ] no response contains stack trace\n[ ] no response contains package/class names\n[ ] correlation ID echoed in response header\n"
      })
